## Context

The component-backed [review of #4471](/kb/incidents/4471-review/) shows distinct parser
and form-hint causes inside one ticket. Identical subjects are insufficient evidence
that two reports describe the same failure.

## Proposed replacement for decision 0001

Read the report body and resolve its tenant, locale, form version and channel. Use
`sameCause` from `src/lib/kb/causes.ts` as the export's operational grouping rule.
Merge only when evidence supports the same cause. Different subjects can describe the
same cause; identical subjects can describe different causes. Unknown tenants and
uncertain failures need investigation before merging.

<DedupeExplorer />

## Consequences

The desk spends time reading and checking tenant data, so separate engineering fixes
remain visible. The five anomalous descriptions in the incident review still require
investigation. This proposal does not rewrite accepted decision 0001 or claim that
the desk has already adopted a new policy.

